message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Synthetic Hydraulic Digital Twin Demo"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-06-03"

authors:
  - family-names: "López Dubón"
    given-names: "Sergio"

abstract: >
  A confidentiality-safe Python research-software demonstration of a synthetic
  hydraulic digital-twin workflow. The project includes synthetic sensor data
  generation, validation, feature engineering, energy modelling, anomaly
  detection, twin-state classification, automated reporting, example visual
  outputs, tests and continuous integration.

keywords:
  - digital twin
  - synthetic data
  - anomaly detection
  - sensor data
  - energy modelling
  - time series
  - research software
  - hydraulic systems
  - Python

license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sergioald/synthetic-hydraulic-digital-twin-demo"
url: "https://github.com/sergioald/synthetic-hydraulic-digital-twin-demo"
